<title>USA: Sioux City hogs $0.25 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs $0.25 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.25 higher. Top $58.25 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     58.25</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     57.50</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     55.50-57.00</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     52.00-55.00</p>
<p>Sows:  steady to 1.00 higher. Top 51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-450 lbs few 46.50</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs     47.50</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs     49.50</p>
<p>	   550-600 lbs     50.00</p>
<p>	   600-700 lbs     51.00</p>
</text>
